              "message": "DDS Import: a parked file keeps its place in a set opened together\n\nA DDS parked behind the prompt was recorded as opened in its batch, so\nthe answered file landed at the end while later members claimed its\nslot. The prompt now holds the OpenOrder, the batch stays alive while a\nmember waits on an answer, and confirm hands the place to the background\ntab or moves the inline-opened document there. open_contents gets the\nsame batch bookkeeping, so content-based multi-opens order too.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
              "url": "https://github.com/Blenux/photocraft/commit/e9eaea5f922f4579ca8ab77cbc90a3ea36b134ab",
