              "message": "file.open: refuse bad DDS params even when no path opens the dialog\n\n`file.open {\"ddsFlip\": \"yes\"}` without a path opened the file dialog and\nsilently dropped the malformed value; the params are parsed before the\npath branch now.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
